  "title": "Tom Cruise Cake",
  "description": "Tom Cruise Cake is a copycat version of the famous white chocolate coconut Bundt cake Tom Cruise gifts for Christmas. It&#39;s a moist, festive cake with loads of coconut flavor!",
  "authors": [
    "Kathryn Hendrix, RDN, LD"
